5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Our quarter-end reporting is a nightmare. I need to know if this new holding will break our audit trail.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am worried about the time we spend sourcing talent. Who can actually be hired right now?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry our success stories are just noise. I want to see who actually kept their customers.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am watching our cash burn. I need to know what we can borrow against if this fails.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am tired of delays. I want to know exactly what stops the product from launching.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
